# Generic Resource (GRES) configuration for NVIDIA GPUs.
#
# This intentionally uses the generic name "gpu" so jobs can request:
#   --gres=gpu:1
#
# One explicit File line is generated per GPU from the nvidia-smi -L GPU count.
# This avoids depending on bracket-pattern handling in a particular Slurm
# version and does not assume a specific model such as A100.

@GPU_GRES_LINES@
